chunks.text:
[The signs]
{a huge orchestra hit with taiko, timpani and a crash on the very first beat, held a moment, then a snare roll}
{a driving battle groove: grinding cellos in eighths, contrabasses and bass drum on every beat}
{low brass stabs, a tense high string figure, a hit with a crash every fourth bar}

[Forge your spells]
{a breath: one bar of silence with a rising choir swell and a reverse cymbal}
{then a brighter, faster montage: snare on the off-beats, the string figure an octave up}
{the horn theme on full brass, a hit every two bars; it stops on a hit}

[The maw waits]
{one deep boom, then only a low drone and a slow heartbeat that quickens}
{a dissonant string tremolo and growling low brass creep in; a sharp stinger near the middle}
{a huge final hit about three quarters through, then near silence, only the drone dying away}
